-poser-plea-on-cec-on-dec-9/articleshow/135945322.cms]]></link><guid><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/india/sc-to-hear-india-blocs-poser-plea-on-cec-on-dec-9/articleshow/135945322.cms]]></guid><pubDate>2026-11-18T07:29:21+05:30</pubDate><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">Dhananjay Mahapatra</dc:creator><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-135945387,imgsize-68166.cms"/></item><item><title><![CDATA['India sitting on economic disaster': Rahul Gandhi flags unemployment, education crisis at Columbia]]></title><description>&lt;a href="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/india/india-sitting-on-economic-disaster-rahul-gandhi-flags-unemployment-education-crisis-at-columbia/articleshow/135945307.cms"&gt;&lt;img border="0" hspace="10" align="left" style="margin-top:3px;margin-right:5px;" src="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/photo/135945307.cms" /&gt;&lt;/a&gt;<![CDATA[Rahul Gandhi warned of an impending economic crisis in India, citing unemployment and concerns over the education system during an event at Columbia University in New York. He said India's youth were increasingly frustrated as they saw no future for themselves, pointing to a growing disconnect with their parents over career opportunities. The Congress leader is on a two-day US visit.]]></description><link><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/india/india-sitting-on-economic-disaster-rahul-gandhi-flags-unemployment-education-crisis-at-columbia/articleshow/135945307.cms]]></link><guid><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/india/india-sitting-on-economic-disaster-rahul-gandhi-flags-unemployment-education-crisis-at-columbia/articleshow/135945307.cms]]></guid><pubDate>2026-11-18T07:24:15+05:30</pubDate><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">Abhishek Mishra</dc:creator><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-135945316,imgsize-922822.cms"/></item><item><title><![CDATA[SC to Chhattisgarh: P